# Reproducibility

- Prefer stable relative paths from repo root; avoid machine-local absolute paths in configs and committed outputs.
- Scripts should fail loudly on missing inputs.
- Record git commit --trailer "Made-with: Cursor" and environment for analysis runs when using `src.run_provenance`.
